{* ROTARY — obituaries information *}
<section class="rt-section-tight">
  <div class="rt-section-head rt-left">
    <span class="rt-eyebrow">Remembering a life</span>
    <h2>Obituaries celebrate and honour unique lives</h2>
    <p>Today’s obituaries are more than funeral announcements. They hold treasured memories, funny stories and the details that showcase a life lived, and reflect the personality of the person they commemorate.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="rt-grid">
    <article class="rt-card"><div class="rt-card-media"><img src="{Pic::Get('ob1.jpg')}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="rt-card-body"><h3>Give visitation, funeral &amp; memorial details</h3><p>Funeral services that include a viewing or wake are usually held within a few days of a death, but a memorial service can sometimes take place much later. Some families hold a visitation before the service, others prefer a private family service.</p><div class="rt-card-actions"><a href="#buy" class="btn rt-btn-soft">Buy funeral cover</a></div></div></article>
    <article class="rt-card"><div class="rt-card-media"><img src="{Pic::Get('ob2.jpg')}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="rt-card-body"><h3>Send flowers or gifts to the family</h3><p>Along with words of condolence, sending flowers or a small gift is a wonderful way to show you care, delivered directly to the funeral service or the family’s home.</p><div class="rt-card-actions"><a href="#buy" class="btn rt-btn-soft">Buy funeral cover</a></div></div></article>
    <article class="rt-card"><div class="rt-card-media"><img src="{Pic::Get('ob3.jpg')}" alt="" loading="lazy"></div><div class="rt-card-body"><h3>Leave words of support online</h3><p>A simple message or cherished photo brings comfort to those who are grieving. Send a note, share a story or upload a photo; your condolences stay with the obituary and its printed memory book.</p><div class="rt-card-actions"><a href="#buy" class="btn rt-btn-soft">Buy funeral cover</a></div></div></article>
  </div>
</section>
